{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24689","headline":"闲居贫活计 · 白居易","name":"闲居贫活计","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"冠盖闲居少，箪瓢陋巷深。\n称家开户牖，量力置园林。\n俭薄身都惯，营爲力不任。\n饥烹一斤肉，暖卧两重衾。\n尊有陶潜酒，囊无陆贾金。\n莫嫌贫活计，更富即劳心。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24689.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24689","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}